      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i spent twenty years building something that doesn't even exist anymore. everything is just... gone. all that time, all that work, and for what? i feel like i just wasted my entire life for nothing. i'm so tired of trying to fix things that are clearly just broken beyond repair.",
