      "content": "resilience doesn't pay the bills or give me my years back. i don't want lessons. i don't want to be \"resilient.\" i just feel like i'm staring at a massive deficit that i can never recover from. it's like i've been playing this game for decades and i just realized the scoreboard is at zero. there’s no point in even staying in the game if the outcome is already decided.",
